+/**
+ * @brief Reprogram the XADC after the PL was configured
+ *
+ * Configuring the PL reloads the XADC registers (sequencer, thresholds, alarm
+ * enables) from the bitstream, so the driver settings are lost. This restores the
+ * sample rate and the sequencer from the devicetree and leaves every alarm
+ * disarmed; triggers and thresholds must be set again afterwards.
